Cell["\<\
That reconfiguration \[LongDash] one setting to the next, never a fresh \
re-derivation \[LongDash] is a genuine gate cascade on the same qutrit, built \
here through the Wolfram Quantum Computation Framework rather than asserted: \
five measurement-context frames, each an orthonormal basis built from two \
adjacent (hence jointly measurable) KCBS directions plus their cross product, \
linked by four incremental transition rotations:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"7f83d869-20b6-b849-87f1-f5189c9294f8"],

