Cell["\<\
Both operations act on a genuine physical qutrit \[LongDash] the same \
three-dimensional system the KCBS pentagon already lives in \[LongDash] so \
they compose as an actual quantum circuit, not just an abstract permutation \
of labels. Built and verified natively through the Wolfram Quantum \
Computation Framework, chaining two direct steps then one twisted step \
\[LongDash] the (ddt) pattern:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"80d804f2-c5da-c84d-8504-c1b6481c8c8e"],

Cell["\<\
Build R_direct and R_twisted as qutrit gates and assemble the (ddt) circuit:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"3b754cbe-1ef1-634f-9f58-1780cd623798"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
QuantumCircuitOperator[{QuantumOperator[Rdirect, 3, \"Label\" -> \"Rd\"], \
QuantumOperator[Rdirect, 3, \"Label\" -> \"Rd\"], QuantumOperator[Rtwisted, \
3, \"Label\" -> \"Rt\"]}, \"Label\" -> \"ddt step\"][\"Diagram\"]\
\>", "Input",
 CellOpen->False,ExpressionUUID->"e3e3ab37-afcb-8a49-89a0-34c7c8270203"],

