Cell["\<\
The Birkhoff average made concrete \[LongDash] slide a window along (ddt)\
\[Infinity] and watch the running mean settle. Schematic only: the per-letter \
weights are a toy potential chosen so the period average lands exactly on \
gap(ddt); real contributions are not letter-additive (a letter's value \
depends on its context \[LongDash] the direct ring's gap density is exactly \
zero even though d carries the larger toy weight here), so the content of \
this demonstration is the convergence, not the decomposition. The visible \
wobble is likewise arithmetic, not geometry: the word has period three, so \
the running mean returns to the limit exactly at every n divisible by 3 (gray \
dots) and overshoots in between, a sawtooth whose amplitude decays like 1/n. \
Shown as a static snapshot (n = 14); the interactive cell is hidden alongside \
and can be evaluated locally:\
\>", "CodeText",ExpressionUUID->"caa30e05-81fa-0c4a-895a-81977e7bb6d2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Manipulate[Module[{seq$, phi$, run$, lim$ = 0.0698975},
   seq$ = Flatten[ConstantArray[{\"d\", \"d\", \"t\"}, 40]];
   phi$ = seq$ /. {\"d\" -> 0.093, \"t\" -> 0.0236925};
   run$ = Accumulate[Take[phi$, n]]/Range[n];
   Column[{Row[Take[seq$, Min[n, 15]] /.
       {\"d\" -> Style[\"d\", RGBColor[0.2, 0.45, 0.85], Bold],
        \"t\" -> Style[\"t\", RGBColor[0.85, 0.55, 0.2], Bold]}, Spacer[2]],
     Show[ListLinePlot[run$,
       PlotStyle -> Directive[RGBColor[0.2, 0.45, 0.85], Thickness[0.006]],
       Joined -> True, PlotRange -> {{0, 120}, {0, 0.11}},
       AxesLabel -> {\"n\", \"advantage per pentagon\"}, ImageSize -> 480,
       ImagePadding -> {{55, 25}, {42, 26}},
       PlotLabel -> Row[{\"running average after \", n, \" blocks = \",
          NumberForm[Last[run$], {4, 4}], \"   (moving \[RightArrow] fixed \
target)\"}]],
      Graphics[{{RGBColor[0.85, 0.55, 0.2], Dashed,
         Line[{{0, lim$}, {120, lim$}}]},
        {RGBColor[0.85, 0.55, 0.2],
         Text[Style[\"fixed target: gap(ddt) = 0.0699  (the n \[RightArrow] \
\[Infinity] limit)\", 9],
          {58, lim$ + 0.012}]},
        {GrayLevel[0.3], PointSize[0.01],
         Point[Table[{k, lim$}, {k, 3, Min[n, 120], 3}]]},
        {RGBColor[0.2, 0.45, 0.85], PointSize[0.02],
         Point[{Min[n, 120], Last[run$]}]}}]]}]],
  {{n, 14, \"blocks averaged n  (1 to 120)\"}, 1, 120, 1,
   Appearance -> \"Labeled\"}, ControlPlacement -> Bottom]\
\>", "Input",
 CellOpen->False,ExpressionUUID->"5c891c81-cdd6-3a42-9c97-6804abedbee3"],

